  "details": "Under certain circumstances, photo cameras (I imagine stream cameras aswell) will be invisible for other clients, which could be a bit worrying privacy-wise.\nThe camera still makes a sound when a picture is taken, but there is no lens or nametag visible for it. The quick menu does not reveal it either.\n\nIt seems to happen consistently when the camera was active before a world transition, might have something to do with the new initial client load.",
